OL,3,GNEWSAPrison officer jailed for
OL,4,Asmuggling phones and drugs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former prison officer who smuggled
OL,7,Fphones and drugs to inmates has been
OL,8,Fjailed.
OL,10,FLeicester Crown Court heard James
OL,11,FSpeirs, 30, who worked at HMP Gartree
OL,12,Fnear Market Harborough, Leicestershire,
OL,13,Fwas part of a "complex network" of
OL,14,Findividuals, who ensured there was a
OL,15,F"constant supply" of contraband into
OL,16,Fthe prison.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
