OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPrison officer jailed for
OL,4,Asmuggling phones and drugs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeirs, New Bilton, Warwickshire,
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to misconduct in a
OL,8,Fpublic office, two counts of conspiracy
OL,9,Fto supply cannabis and two counts of
OL,10,Fconspiracy to bring a List B prohibited
OL,11,Farticle into and out of a prison.
OL,13,FOn Friday, Judge Timothy Spencer KC
OL,14,Fsentenced Speirs to six years in
OL,15,Fprison.
